ll},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-01-27T02:00:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-15T19:03:56Z","closed_at":"2026-05-13T08:37:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6.\n- Not reproducible in 4.5.1.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9144) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K (32 threads) - 63.71 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a scene with ~5k nested resources (a procedurally generated game map). Some of the deeply nested resources are referenced in other resources and nodes within the scene.\n\nOpening the scene in the editor, selecting different nodes, and expanding resource trees works fine. However, if I switch to another scene (tab), switching back to the large scene hangs the editor for multiple minutes on my beefy machine.\n\nThis occurs in the official stable 4.6 build, but does NOT occur on 4.5.1. Testing on a clean build of the 4.6 branch, I see that most of the time is spent in `EditorNode::gather_resources()`, downstream from `EditorResourcePicker::_is_uniqueness_enabled()`. **Editing the code to make `_is_uniqueness_enabled()` do nothing and return `true` fixes the freeze.**\n\nFrom a cursory skim, this appears related to #109458.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Have a scene with thousands of subresources. Nesting seems to make it worse.\n- Open this scene and another small scene.\n- Switch to the small scene then back to the big scene.\n- Observe a minutes-long freeze.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[inspector-freeze-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24871845/inspector-freeze-test.zip)\n\nThis is a tiny project. It doesn't behave as severely as my real project because the resources are tiny, but it still takes 5 seconds to switch scenes on 4.6, while it's instant in 4.5. To repro, open the `main` scene and the `empty_scene`. In `main`, click `Fill Array`. Now switch between the two scene tabs.","closed_by":{"login":"max99x","id":680351,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDM1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/680351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x","html_url":"https://github.com/max99x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115420/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":10},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115420/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}